msgctxt "#31030"
msgid "PCM Max Sink Bits"
msgstr "PCM 最大位深限制"

msgctxt "#31031"
msgid "Limit PCM bit depth to fix DAC handshake pop/noise"
msgstr "限制 PCM 位深，解决 DAC/功放握手异常与爆音"

msgctxt "#31032"
msgid "PCM Max Sink Bits limit (0=unrestricted auto-negotiation, typical: 16, 24, 32). For PCM output, if external DAC/receiver fails at 32-bit handshake or produces popping noise, limit to 16 or 24."
msgstr "PCM 最大位深限制 (0=不限制由硬件自协商, 常用值: 16, 24, 32)。针对非源码透传(PCM输出)时，若外部DAC/功放与32bit握手异常或出现爆音，可限制为16或24。"

msgctxt "#31033"
msgid "Audio Sink Settle Hold Time"
msgstr "音频输出初始化静音保持时间"

msgctxt "#31034"
msgid "Mute on audio format switch to eliminate clock lock pops"
msgstr "切音频格式时静音指定时间，彻底消除时钟锁定爆音"

msgctxt "#31035"
msgid "Audio sink settle hold mute time in milliseconds (0-2000 ms, default: 0). Mutes audio output when switching format/sample rate to eliminate AVR clock-locking pops."
msgstr "音频输出初始化静音保持时间 (单位: 毫秒, 范围: 0-2000, 默认: 0)。在切换音频格式/采样率时静音指定时间，彻底消除功放/回音壁锁定时钟瞬间的“噼啪”爆音。"

msgctxt "#31040"
msgid "Menu Domain Queue Time Size"
msgstr "蓝光/DVD 菜单缓冲队列时长"

msgctxt "#31041"
msgid "Increase menu buffer to avoid disc navigation stutter"
msgstr "增大菜单缓冲，避免播放原盘导航时的卡顿与加载延迟"

msgctxt "#31042"
msgid "Blu-ray/DVD interactive menu domain buffer queue duration in seconds (0.0-16.0, default: 1.0). Avoids stutter and loading delays during disc navigation."
msgstr "蓝光/DVD 交互菜单域数据缓冲队列时长 (单位: 秒, 范围: 0.0-16.0, 默认: 1.0)。增大该值可有效避免播放原盘导航菜单时的卡顿与加载延迟。"

msgctxt "#31043"
msgid "Seamless Branching Boundary Drain"
msgstr "蓝光无缝分段跨片段边界排空"

msgctxt "#31044"
msgid "Drain decoder buffer on slice jump to avoid desync/artifacts"
msgstr "分段跳转排空旧缓冲，防跨切片音画不同步或马赛克"

msgctxt "#31045"
msgid "Seamless branching boundary buffer drain (default: true). Flushes decoder buffer on slice transitions to prevent AV sync loss or macroblocking across m2ts boundaries."
msgstr "蓝光无缝分段(Seamless Branching)跨片段边界排空缓冲 (默认: true)。在蓝光切片跳转时排空旧解码缓冲，防止多版本/分段蓝光跨 m2ts 衔接处出现音画不同步或马赛克。"

msgctxt "#31046"
msgid "Async Subtitle Parsing"
msgstr "异步字幕解析"

msgctxt "#31047"
msgid "Parse ASS/PGS subtitles in worker thread to prevent frame drops"
msgstr "后台线程解析 ASS/PGS 字幕，消除字幕加载瞬间掉帧"

msgctxt "#31048"
msgid "Asynchronous subtitle parsing (default: true). Offloads complex ASS/SSA and PGS subtitles to worker threads, eliminating frame stutter when loading subtitles."
msgstr "异步字幕解析 (默认: true)。将 ASS/SSA 复杂特效字幕和 PGS 图形字幕解析移至后台工作线程，消除加载字幕瞬间的掉帧微卡。"

msgctxt "#31049"
msgid "Async Fullscreen OSD Mode"
msgstr "全屏 OSD 异步渲染模式"

msgctxt "#31050"
msgid "Decouple OSD rendering from video playback for smooth UI"
msgstr "解耦全屏播放与 OSD 渲染，大幅提升进度条流畅度"

msgctxt "#31051"
msgid "Async fullscreen OSD mode (0=disable, 1=force enable, 2=auto/active video only, default: 2). Decouples progress bars/info panels from video render thread for smooth animations."
msgstr "全屏 OSD 异步渲染模式 (0=禁用, 1=强制开启, 2=自动/仅全屏视频活动时开启, 默认: 2)。将全屏播放时的进度条、信息面板等 OSD 渲染与主视频播放解耦，大幅提升 OSD 弹出与滑动流畅度。"

msgctxt "#31052"
msgid "Async Video Layer Render"
msgstr "异步视频图层渲染"

msgctxt "#31053"
msgid "Async video layer rendering (disable if complex subtitles flicker)"
msgstr "异步视频图层渲染 (特效字幕闪烁时可关闭)"

msgctxt "#31054"
msgid "Async video layer rendering (default: true). If stylized subtitles flicker on certain firmware versions, set to false to resolve."
msgstr "异步视频图层渲染 (默认: true)。若在部分新版固件遇到特效字幕闪烁，改为 false 可以彻底解决。"

msgctxt "#31055"
msgid "Min Seek Distance Before EOF"
msgstr "片尾最小 Seek 安全距离"

msgctxt "#31056"
msgid "Prevent accidental playback exit when seeking near end of file"
msgstr "防止跳转过于靠近片尾直接触发退出或连播下一集"

msgctxt "#31057"
msgid "Minimum seek distance before EOF in seconds (0-600, default: 10). Prevents jumping too close to EOF from prematurely terminating playback or jumping to next episode."
msgstr "文件末尾最小 Seek 安全距离 (单位: 秒, 范围: 0-600, 默认: 10)。防止快进/Seek 过于靠近片尾时直接触发意外退出或连播下一个视频。"

msgctxt "#31058"
msgid "Force Dolby Vision VSVDB V1 Block"
msgstr "强制 Dolby Vision VSVDB V1 数据块"

msgctxt "#31059"
msgid "Only for legacy displays that only support Dolby Vision V1 VSVDB"
msgstr "仅在连接极老款 V1 规范杜比视界电视/投影时开启"

msgctxt "#31060"
msgid "Force Dolby Vision VSVDB V1 block (default: false). Kodi defaults to standard V2 format. Enable only when connecting to legacy DV displays supporting V1 only."
msgstr "强制使用 Dolby Vision VSVDB V1 数据块 (默认: false)。默认使用标准的 V2 格式。若连接极老款仅支持 V1 规范的杜比视界电视/投影仪时可设为 true。"

msgctxt "#31061"
msgid "Deinterlace Delay Compensation"
msgstr "硬件反交错延迟补偿"

msgctxt "#31062"
msgid "Compensate for hardware deinterlace latency on 50i/60i streams"
msgstr "补偿硬件反交错时延，保证 50i/60i 隔行源唇音同步"

msgctxt "#31063"
msgid "Interlaced hardware deinterlacing delay compensation (default: false). Offsets 1-2 field clock delays introduced by hardware deinterlacer for perfect lip-sync."
msgstr "隔行扫描硬件反交错延迟补偿 (默认: false)。针对 50i/60i 等反交错流，自动补偿硬件 Deinterlacer 带来的 1~2 场时钟延迟以保证绝对唇音同步。"

msgctxt "#31064"
msgid "Video Rate Field Hold"
msgstr "视频场频保持"

msgctxt "#31065"
msgid "Prevent frequent refresh rate shifts on mixed cadence streams"
msgstr "抑制隔行/逐行交替频繁切换刷新率，防止黑屏闪烁"

msgctxt "#31066"
msgid "Video rate field hold (default: true). Suppresses rapid HDMI refresh rate switching on interlaced/progressive hybrid content to prevent black screen flashing."
msgstr "视频场频保持 (默认: true)。播放隔行/逐行交替片源时抑制过快的刷新率反复切换，避免电视黑屏闪烁。"

msgctxt "#31067"
msgid "VC-1 Decoder Driver Injection"
msgstr "VC-1 硬件解码驱动注入"

msgctxt "#31068"
msgid "Inject interlace mode into driver to fix VC-1 stutter and green screen"
msgstr "区分逐行与隔行并写入驱动，根治晶晨 VC-1 卡顿与绿屏"

msgctxt "#31069"
msgid "VC-1 Amlogic hardware decoder optimization (default: true). Injects mode into /sys/module/amvdec_vc1/parameters/force_frame_int to eliminate VC-1 playback stutter and green screens."
msgstr "VC-1 Amlogic 硬件解码优化: 自动区分逐行与隔行并写入驱动 (默认: true)。自动向 /sys/module/amvdec_vc1/parameters/force_frame_int 注入模式，彻底根治晶晨芯片 VC-1 播放卡顿与绿屏。"

msgctxt "#31070"
msgid "VC-1 Drop Corrupt Frames"
msgstr "VC-1 坏帧丢弃机制"

msgctxt "#31071"
msgid "Drop corrupt frames to prevent hardware decoder deadlock"
msgstr "允许损坏帧丢帧恢复，防止解码器死锁假死"

msgctxt "#31072"
msgid "VC-1 corrupt frame drop mechanism (default: true). Drops broken or misaligned VC-1 frames to prevent hardware decoder deadlocks."
msgstr "VC-1 坏帧丢弃机制 (默认: true)。遇到损坏或时间戳错乱的 VC-1 帧允许解码器丢帧恢复，防止解码器死锁假死。"

msgctxt "#31073"
msgid "VC-1 Timestamp Auto-Repair"
msgstr "VC-1 时间戳自动修复"

msgctxt "#31074"
msgid "Recalibrate jittered timestamps for smooth 23.976fps playback"
msgstr "重校准抖动的时间戳，保证 23.976fps 流畅播放"

msgctxt "#31075"
msgid "VC-1 timestamp auto-repair (default: true). Recalibrates jittered PTS/DTS timestamps to maintain smooth 23.976fps playback."
msgstr "VC-1 时间戳自动修复 (默认: true)。对 PTS/DTS 时间戳抖动不平整的 VC-1 片源进行重校准，保证 23.976fps 流畅播放。"

msgctxt "#31080"
msgid "EGL Buffer Age Partial Redraw"
msgstr "EGL Buffer Age 局部重绘"

msgctxt "#31081"
msgid "Enable dirty region redraws to cut Mali GPU load and thermals"
msgstr "利用局部脏区重绘大幅降低 Mali GPU 负载与发热"

msgctxt "#31082"
msgid "EGL Buffer Age partial redraw (0=disable, 1=enable, default: 1). Significantly reduces Mali GPU load and heat, improving UI responsiveness."
msgstr "基于 EGL Buffer Age 的局部重绘 (0=关闭/全屏重绘, 1=开启局部脏区重绘, 默认: 1)。大幅减轻 Amlogic Mali GPU 渲染负担，显著降低发热并提升操作跟手度。"

msgctxt "#31083"
msgid "Update Buffer Age After Render Scope"
msgstr "渲染结束后更新 Buffer Age"

msgctxt "#31084"
msgid "Update Buffer Age tracking after render scope ends (default: true)"
msgstr "渲染作用域结束后更新 Buffer Age 跟踪 (默认: true)"

msgctxt "#31085"
msgid "Update Buffer Age tracking after render scope (default: true). Accurately maintains dirty regions across swap buffers."
msgstr "渲染作用域结束后更新 Buffer Age 跟踪 (默认: true)。配合局部重绘精准管理双缓冲或三缓冲脏区寿命。"

msgctxt "#31086"
msgid "Max Dirty Regions Count"
msgstr "最大独立脏区跟踪矩形数"

msgctxt "#31087"
msgid "Limit tracked dirty rectangles (0-64, default: 4)"
msgstr "跟踪矩形数量限制 (0-64, 默认: 4)，超额合并包围盒"

msgctxt "#31088"
msgid "Maximum discrete dirty regions (0-64, default: 4). Merges into a single bounding box when exceeded to balance CPU calculation and GPU draw cost."
msgstr "最大独立脏区跟踪矩形数 (范围: 0-64, 默认: 4)。超过该数量时合并为单一外接大包围盒，平衡 CPU 碰撞计算与 GPU 绘制开销。"

msgctxt "#31089"
msgid "Skip Sleep Active Window"
msgstr "交互后跳过休眠活动窗口时间"

msgctxt "#31090"
msgid "Keep maximum frame rate right after input for fluid response"
msgstr "按键滑动后指定时间内不限速，保证即时丝滑响应"

msgctxt "#31091"
msgid "Skip sleep active window after user interaction in milliseconds (0-2000 ms, default: 250). Guarantees instantaneous fluid response upon keypress or scroll."
msgstr "交互后跳过休眠的活动窗口时间 (单位: 毫秒, 范围: 0-2000, 默认: 250)。用户按键或滑动列表后的 250ms 内不限速，保证界面即时丝滑响应。"

msgctxt "#31092"
msgid "Menu Idle Framerate Cap"
msgstr "菜单静止/空闲帧率上限"

msgctxt "#31093"
msgid "Cap UI FPS during idle (0=unlimited, default: 0)"
msgstr "界面停顿时限制帧率 (0=不限制/跟随刷新率, 默认: 0)"

msgctxt "#31094"
msgid "Menu idle framerate cap in FPS (0=unlimited, range: 0-60, default: 0). Cap to 20 or 30 FPS to reduce power and temperature while sitting idle."
msgstr "菜单静止/空闲时的帧率上限 (单位: FPS, 0=不限制/跟随刷新率, 范围: 0-60, 默认: 0)。若希望机顶盒在界面停顿时极度省电与降温，可设为 30 或 20。"

msgctxt "#31095"
msgid "Skin HDR FBO Rendering"
msgstr "皮肤 HDR 帧缓冲渲染"

msgctxt "#31096"
msgid "Experimental: render skin in wide color gamut HDR FBO"
msgstr "实验性：允许皮肤直接在 HDR FBO 中以宽色域渲染"

msgctxt "#31097"
msgid "Skin HDR frame buffer rendering (0=disable, 1=enable, default: 0). Experimental: renders Kodi skin directly in HDR FBO with wide color gamut."
msgstr "皮肤 HDR 帧缓冲渲染 (0=关闭, 1=开启, 默认: 0)。实验性：允许 Kodi 皮肤直接在 HDR FBO 中以宽色域渲染。"

msgctxt "#31098"
msgid "OSD Guest Composite Mode"
msgstr "OSD 客制化合成模式"

msgctxt "#31099"
msgid "Custom composite mode (0=default, 1=enable, default: 0)"
msgstr "OSD 客制化合成模式 (0=默认, 1=开启, 默认: 0)"

msgctxt "#31100"
msgid "OSD guest composite mode (0=default, 1=enable, default: 0)."
msgstr "OSD 客制化合成模式 (0=默认, 1=开启, 默认: 0)。"

msgctxt "#31101"
msgid "OSD Dirty Region Trace"
msgstr "OSD 脏区调试跟踪"

msgctxt "#31102"
msgid "Dirty region debug trace (0=disable, 1=enable, default: 0)"
msgstr "脏区可视化调试跟踪 (0=关闭, 1=开启, 默认: 0)"

msgctxt "#31103"
msgid "OSD dirty region debug trace (0=disable, 1=enable, default: 0). Used for visualizing partial redraw bounds."
msgstr "OSD 脏区调试跟踪 (0=关闭, 1=开启, 默认: 0)。用于开发者调试界面局部重绘范围。"

msgctxt "#31104"
msgid "GUI Texture Anisotropic Filtering"
msgstr "GUI 材质各向异性过滤"

msgctxt "#31105"
msgid "Improve sharpness of posters/text at oblique angles (default: 0)"
msgstr "提升倾斜视角/3D视图下海报和文字清晰度 (默认: 0)"

msgctxt "#31106"
msgid "GUI texture anisotropic filtering (values: 0, 2, 4, 8, 16, default: 0). Enhances poster and text clarity when viewed at oblique angles."
msgstr "GUI 材质各向异性过滤 (可选值: 0, 2, 4, 8, 16, 默认: 0 关闭)。提升倾斜视角或 3D 视图中皮肤海报和文字的清晰度。"

msgctxt "#31107"
msgid "Front-to-Back Render Sorting"
msgstr "从前到后渲染排序"

msgctxt "#31108"
msgid "Early depth testing to cut layer overdraw (default: false)"
msgstr "通过早期深度测试减少透明/不透明图层 Overdraw 覆写"

msgctxt "#31109"
msgid "Front-to-Back render sorting (default: false). Utilizes early depth testing to reduce overdraw between opaque/transparent layers."
msgstr "由前到后 (Front-to-Back) 渲染排序 (默认: false)。配合早期深度测试减少透明/不透明图层之间的 Overdraw 覆写开销。"

msgctxt "#31110"
msgid "Clear Geometry Before Swap"
msgstr "帧交换前清空几何体缓冲"

msgctxt "#31111"
msgid "Clear geometry buffer prior to swap buffers (default: true)"
msgstr "帧交换前清空几何体缓冲 (默认: true)"

msgctxt "#31112"
msgid "Clear geometry buffer before buffer swap (default: true). Prevents stale vertices from polluting the next frame."
msgstr "帧交换前清空几何体缓冲 (默认: true)。防止残存几何顶点污染下一帧画面。"

msgctxt "#31113"
msgid "Wait VSync Before Swap"
msgstr "帧交换前等待垂直同步"

msgctxt "#31114"
msgid "Wait for VSync to prevent UI tearing and stabilize frame rate"
msgstr "等待垂直同步，防止界面滑动撕裂并稳定帧率"

msgctxt "#31115"
msgid "Wait for vertical synchronization before swapping buffers (default: true). Prevents UI tearing and locks to smooth refresh intervals."
msgstr "交换前后缓冲前等待垂直同步 (默认: true)。防止界面滑动撕裂，提供平滑 VSync 锁定。"

msgctxt "#31116"
msgid "Wait GPU Before Swap"
msgstr "帧交换前等待 GPU 执行完毕"

msgctxt "#31117"
msgid "Wait GPU mode (0=never, 1=always, 2=fullscreen video, default: 2)"
msgstr "全屏播放时等待 GPU (0=不等待, 1=始终, 2=仅全屏, 默认: 2)"

msgctxt "#31118"
msgid "Wait for GPU execution completion before swap (0=no, 1=always, 2=fullscreen video only, default: 2). Ensures video plane and OSD/subtitles refresh in lockstep."
msgstr "帧交换前等待 GPU 执行完毕 (0=不等待, 1=始终等待, 2=仅全屏视频播放时等待, 默认: 2)。设为 2 时保证全屏播放下视频平面与界面字幕/OSD 刷新步调严格一致。"

msgctxt "#31119"
msgid "sRGB Color Corrected Compositing"
msgstr "sRGB 色彩校正混合"

msgctxt "#31120"
msgid "Prevent SDR skin over HDR/DV video from oversaturating"
msgstr "避免 SDR 皮肤覆盖在 HDR/杜比视频上时过饱和刺眼"

msgctxt "#31121"
msgid "sRGB color-corrected compositing (default: true). Prevents SDR interface elements from appearing blown-out or oversaturated over HDR/Dolby Vision video."
msgstr "sRGB 色彩校正混合 (默认: true)。避免 SDR 皮肤界面在覆盖于 HDR / Dolby Vision 视频上方时产生色彩过饱和与刺眼过曝。"

msgctxt "#31122"
msgid "Composite Dithering"
msgstr "界面合成抖动抗色带"

msgctxt "#31123"
msgid "Eliminate color banding on dark gradients and translucent overlays"
msgstr "消除暗色渐变背景与半透明浮层上的阶梯色彩断层"

msgctxt "#31124"
msgid "UI composite dithering (default: true). Eliminates stair-stepped color banding on dark gradient backgrounds and translucent layers."
msgstr "界面合成抖动抗色带处理 (默认: true)。消除暗色渐变背景和半透明浮层上的阶梯色彩断层(Color Banding)。"

msgctxt "#31125"
msgid "Async Texture Upload (PBO)"
msgstr "异步材质上传 PBO"

msgctxt "#31126"
msgid "Upload poster thumbnails in background using PBO"
msgstr "使用 PBO 在后台上传海报缩略图，杜绝快速翻页顿卡"

msgctxt "#31127"
msgid "Async texture upload via PBO (default: true). Uploads poster textures asynchronously using Pixel Buffer Objects to prevent scrolling micro-stutters."
msgstr "异步材质上传 PBO (默认: true)。使用 Pixel Buffer Object 在后台上传海报缩略图，杜绝快速翻页时的微顿卡。"

msgctxt "#31128"
msgid "Skin Texture Mipmapping"
msgstr "皮肤纹理多级渐远纹理"

msgctxt "#31129"
msgid "Generate mipmaps for UI skin textures (default: false)"
msgstr "生成多级渐远纹理 (默认: false)"

msgctxt "#31130"
msgid "Skin texture mipmapping (default: false). Improves visual antialiasing for downscaled icons at the expense of slight VRAM overhead."
msgstr "皮肤纹理 Mipmapping 多级渐远纹理 (默认: false)。开启后可提升缩小图标抗锯齿平滑度，但会略微增加显存占用。"

msgctxt "#31131"
msgid "Mipmap Sharpen Bias"
msgstr "Mipmap 锐化偏差值"

msgctxt "#31132"
msgid "LOD bias (0.0-3.0, default: 0.5) to sharpen small icons"
msgstr "负向 LOD 偏移 (0.0-3.0, 默认: 0.5)，改善图标清晰锐利度"

msgctxt "#31133"
msgid "Mipmap sharpening bias (range: 0.0-3.0, default: 0.5). Applies negative LOD bias to enhance sharpness of small UI textures."
msgstr "Mipmap 锐化偏差值 (范围: 0.0-3.0, 默认: 0.5)。负向 LOD 偏移，改善微缩图标的清晰锐利度。"

msgctxt "#31134"
msgid "Minified Only Mipmapping"
msgstr "仅针对缩小纹理生成 Mipmap"

msgctxt "#31135"
msgid "Conserve VRAM by only generating mipmaps for downscaled textures"
msgstr "节省显存，仅为小尺寸缩略图生成 Mipmap (默认: true)"

msgctxt "#31136"
msgid "Only generate mipmaps for downscaled textures (default: true). Conserves GPU memory while maintaining clarity."
msgstr "仅针对缩小显示的纹理生成 Mipmap (默认: true)。节省显存占用，只为小尺寸缩略图生成 Mipmap。"

msgctxt "#31137"
msgid "Case Sensitive Local Art Match"
msgstr "本地封面海报区分大小写"

msgctxt "#31138"
msgid "Set false on SMB/NFS with mixed case art to prevent missing posters"
msgstr "SMB/NAS 挂载下混有 Poster.JPG 时设为 false 避免漏图"

msgctxt "#31139"
msgid "Case-sensitive local art matching (default: true). Set to false if SMB/NFS shares contain mixed-case filenames like Poster.JPG to avoid missing artwork."
msgstr "本地同名封面/海报是否区分大小写 (默认: true)。若挂载 Linux/NAS/SMB 共享中混有 Poster.JPG 与 poster.jpg，设为 false 可避免搜刮漏图。"

msgctxt "#31140"
msgid "NFS Connection Timeout"
msgstr "NFS 连接超时时间"

msgctxt "#31141"
msgid "NFS connection timeout in seconds (0-3600, default: 0)"
msgstr "NFS 连接超时 (单位: 秒, 0-3600, 默认: 0 不超时)"

msgctxt "#31142"
msgid "NFS connection timeout in seconds (range: 0-3600, default: 0). Set to 0 to let OS kernel handle timeout."
msgstr "NFS 连接超时时间 (单位: 秒, 范围: 0-3600, 默认: 0)。设置为 0 时由内核协议栈自定。"

msgctxt "#31143"
msgid "NFS Retries Count"
msgstr "NFS 重试次数"

msgctxt "#31144"
msgid "NFS network retry count (-1 to 30, -1 is default)"
msgstr "NFS 网络重试次数 (-1 到 30, -1 为系统默认)"

msgctxt "#31145"
msgid "NFS retry count (range: -1 to 30, default: -1). Maximum connection retry attempts on NFS mount failures."
msgstr "NFS 重试次数 (范围: -1 到 30, -1 为默认)。指定在 NFS 挂载通信失败时的最大自动重试次数。"

msgctxt "#31146"
msgid "Remote Database Connect Timeout"
msgstr "远程数据库连接超时保护"

msgctxt "#31147"
msgid "Cap MySQL timeout to 5s to prevent boot freeze on sleep NAS"
msgstr "限制远程 MySQL 超时为 5 秒，防止断网时开机卡死"

msgctxt "#31148"
msgid "Remote MySQL/MariaDB connect timeout protection (default: 5s). Prevents Kodi from hanging at splash screen when NAS is sleeping; synchronizes across Video, Music, TV, and EPG databases."
msgstr "远程 MySQL/MariaDB 连接超时保护 (默认: 5 秒)。防止 NAS 睡眠或断网时 Kodi 启动死锁卡在黑屏或 Splash 界面，同步应用于 Video/Music/TV/EPG 数据库。"

msgctxt "#31149"
msgid "Blu-ray ISO Cache Page Size"
msgstr "蓝光 ISO 缓存页大小"

msgctxt "#31150"
msgid "Cache page size in bytes (default: 262144 = 256KB)"
msgstr "缓存页大小 (默认: 256KB。纯 R10 可保留；F10 已内化为 LRU)"

msgctxt "#31151"
msgid "Blu-ray ISO cache page size in bytes (default: 262144 = 256KB). Optimizes block I/O throughput when reading ISOs on Amlogic SoC."
msgstr "蓝光 ISO 块缓存页大小 (单位: 字节, 默认: 262144 即 256KB)。优化晶晨芯片直接解包读取 ISO 原盘时的 I/O 吞吐。\n\n【固件版本说明】此项由 R10 引入。如果你使用的是纯 R10 镜像，可保留此项；若是最新 F10，此项已内化为 LRU 机制。"

msgctxt "#31152"
msgid "Blu-ray ISO Max Memory Cache"
msgstr "蓝光 ISO 最大内存缓存"

msgctxt "#31153"
msgid "Maximum cache in bytes (default: 67108864 = 64MB)"
msgstr "最大内存缓存 (默认: 64MB。纯 R10 可保留；F10 已内化为 LRU)"

msgctxt "#31154"
msgid "Blu-ray ISO max memory cache in bytes (default: 67108864 = 64MB). Prevents out-of-memory errors while buffering disc reads."
msgstr "蓝光 ISO 最大内存缓存限制 (单位: 字节, 默认: 67108864 即 64MB)。防止内存溢出同时提供充裕的原盘分段读取缓冲。\n\n【固件版本说明】此项由 R10 引入。如果你使用的是纯 R10 镜像，可保留此项；若是最新 F10，此项已内化为 LRU 机制。"

msgctxt "#31155"
msgid "Blu-ray ISO Forward Prefetch Pages"
msgstr "蓝光 ISO 顺序读取预读页数"

msgctxt "#31156"
msgid "Forward prefetch pages count (range: 0-16, default: 1)"
msgstr "顺序读取预读页数 (默认: 1。纯 R10 可保留；F10 已内化为 LRU)"

msgctxt "#31157"
msgid "Blu-ray ISO forward prefetch pages (range: 0-16, default: 1). Note: Introduced in R10; F10 and later internalized this into an automatic LRU mechanism."
msgstr "蓝光 ISO 顺序读取预读页数 (范围: 0-16, 默认: 1)。\n\n【固件版本说明】此项由 R10 引入。如果你使用的是纯 R10 镜像，可保留此项；若是最新 F10，此项已内化为 LRU 机制。"

msgctxt "#31158"
msgid "R10/F10 Firmware Settings Overview"
msgstr "R10/F10 固件高级设置状态总览"

msgctxt "#31159"
msgid "Currently set to recommended default"
msgstr "当前配置为推荐默认值"

msgctxt "#31160"
msgid "Unconfigured"
msgstr "未配置"

msgctxt "#31408"
msgid "Remote Control Auto-Adapter"
msgstr "遥控器适配工具"

msgctxt "#31409"
msgid "Adapt various IR/Bluetooth/2.4G remotes for CoreELEC"
msgstr "为 CoreELEC 系统适配各种红外/蓝牙/2.4G遥控器"

msgctxt "#31410"
msgid "Select Remote to Adapt"
msgstr "请选择需要适配的遥控器"

msgctxt "#31411"
msgid "Restore Previous Remote Backup"
msgstr "★ 还原上一次的遥控器配置备份"

msgctxt "#31412"
msgid "This feature is only supported on CoreELEC systems."
msgstr "未检测到 CoreELEC 环境，此工具仅适用于 CoreELEC！"

msgctxt "#31413"
msgid "About to adapt remote: [%s]\nExisting configuration will be backed up automatically.\nContinue?"
msgstr "即将为系统适配：[%s]\n旧配置将被自动安全备份。\n是否继续应用此配置？"

msgctxt "#31414"
msgid "Remote [%s] applied successfully! Keymaps reloaded."
msgstr "【%s】配置已成功应用并实时生效！"

msgctxt "#31415"
msgid "Hardware driver changes detected for [%s]. A reboot is required to take effect.\nReboot now?"
msgstr "【%s】底层硬件驱动已写入完成！\n检测到底层配置变更，必须重启才能生效。\n是否立即重启设备？"

msgctxt "#31416"
msgid "No remote configuration backup found."
msgstr "未找到可用的遥控器配置备份。"

msgctxt "#31417"
msgid "Previous remote backup restored successfully! Reboot now?"
msgstr "遥控器配置备份已成功还原！是否立即重启设备生效？"

msgctxt "#31418"
msgid "Failed to apply remote configuration: %s"
msgstr "遥控器适配执行失败：%s"

msgctxt "#31419"
msgid "Restore Factory IR Remote (remote.conf)"
msgstr "★ 恢复出厂红外遥控配置 (remote.conf)"

msgctxt "#31420"
msgid "Factory IR remote configuration restored successfully! Reboot now?"
msgstr "出厂红外遥控配置已成功恢复！是否立即重启设备生效？"

msgctxt "#31500"
msgid "Daily Auto Reboot"
msgstr "每日自动重启"

msgctxt "#31501"
msgid "Set up a systemd timer to reboot CoreELEC daily"
msgstr "设置系统定时器，让 CoreELEC 每天自动重启释放内存"

msgctxt "#31502"
msgid "Daily Auto Reboot - Status: %s"
msgstr "每日自动重启 - 当前状态：%s"

msgctxt "#31503"
msgid "Enabled (Daily at %s)"
msgstr "已开启 (每天 %s)"

msgctxt "#31504"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "未开启"

msgctxt "#31505"
msgid "1. Set / Change Auto Reboot Time"
msgstr "1. 设置 / 修改 自动重启时间"

msgctxt "#31506"
msgid "2. Disable Daily Auto Reboot"
msgstr "2. 关闭 每日自动重启"

msgctxt "#31507"
msgid "Set daily auto reboot time:"
msgstr "请设置每天自动重启的时间："

msgctxt "#31508"
msgid "Auto reboot configured! System will reboot daily at %s.\n(Loop protection enabled)"
msgstr "设置成功！系统将在每天 %s 自动执行重启。\n(已开启防死循环保护)"

msgctxt "#31509"
msgid "Daily auto reboot disabled successfully."
msgstr "已成功关闭每日自动重启功能。"

msgctxt "#31510"
msgid "Daily auto reboot is not enabled currently."
msgstr "当前未开启自动重启，无需关闭。"

msgctxt "#31511"
msgid "Failed to configure auto reboot: %s"
msgstr "自动重启设置失败：%s"



